isa-check (0.1ubuntu) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
    - Build the CLI on all architectures and support native ARM feature fields.
    - Refresh initramfs images on package installation, upgrade, and removal.
    - Move the original /init to /next-init and hand off to it.
    - Dynamically link the no-op chainloader and include its initramfs
      dependencies.
    - Add installed-package and QEMU early-boot regression tests.

